sentences.text:
The sentence imposed by the learned Judicial Magistrate First Class, Municipal Court, Surat in PFA Case No.30 of 2002 dated 12.1.2010,
which is confirmed by the learned Ninth Additional Sessions Judge, Surat, vide judgment and order passed in Criminal Appeal No.14 of 2010 dated 18.1.2017, are hereby suspended and on their executing personal bond of Rs.10,000/- (Rupees Ten Thousand only) each and one surety of like amount to the satisfaction of the Trial Court and subject to the conditions that they shall;
(a) surrender passport, if any, to the lower court within a week;
(b) not leave the State of Gujarat without prior permission of the Trial Court;
HC-NIC Page 2 of 3 Created On Thu Jan 26 02:02:24 IST  R/CR.RA/64/2017 ORDER (c) furnish the present address of residence to the I.O. and also to the Court at the time of execution of the bond and shall not change the residence without prior permission of this Court;
Direct service is permitted.

opennyai_summary.decision:
2. In the main Criminal Revision Application, the applicants herein original accused has prayed to release them on bail by suspending the sentence imposed by the learned Ninth Additional Sessions Judge, Surat, vide judgment and order passed in Criminal Appeal No.14 of 2010 dated 18.1.2017,
whereby the learned Sessions Judge has confirmed the judgment and order passed by the learned Judicial Magistrate First Class, Municipal Court, Surat in PFA Case No.30 of 2002 dated 12.1.2010,
whereby learned trial Judge has convicted and sentenced the applicant for the offence punishable under HC-NIC Page 1 of 3
He further states that the applicants are ready to abide by any suitable conditions imposed by this Court.
He, therefore, prays to grant the bail to the applicants by suspending the sentence till disposal of the present Revision Application.
